    "detailed_description": "<h1>Play the Demo First!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755950/extras/d41f8613902e05b10c2583eddcefef6f.avif?t=1754112872\" data-has-big width=800 height=260 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Tidebound is a game that seamlessly blends the tranquility of fishing with the strategic depth of inventory management, offering a serene yet engaging gaming experience. At its heart, Tidebound is a farming simulator, where players immerse themselves in fishing activities, creature collection, and effective resource management.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755950/extras/a686f2257449697e5e3b240594ccda3b.poster.avif?t=1754112872\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755950/extras/a686f2257449697e5e3b240594ccda3b.webm?t=1754112872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755950/extras/a686f2257449697e5e3b240594ccda3b.mp4?t=1754112872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><br>Inventory management is a critical aspect of gameplay. Players must efficiently manage the resources they gather, whether from the sea, their farms, or during their explorations. Balancing storage space, deciding which resources to keep, sell, or use, and upgrading equipment are all strategic decisions that affect progress in the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755950/extras/e0fa23b9c7f1ef2de45a55801ad5e254.poster.avif?t=1754112872\" width=614 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755950/extras/e0fa23b9c7f1ef2de45a55801ad5e254.webm?t=1754112872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755950/extras/e0fa23b9c7f1ef2de45a55801ad5e254.mp4?t=1754112872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chill &amp; Engaging Atmosphere</h2><br>Despite its depth, Tidebound maintains a relaxing and casual atmosphere. It's designed to be accessible to players who prefer a more laid-back gaming experience, yet it still offers enough complexity and challenge to keep more seasoned gamers engaged.<br><br>In summary, Tidebound is a rich and varied experience, offering players a unique blend of activities and challenges. Whether you're a fan of meticulous resource management, the calmness of fishing, the satisfaction of a well-tended farm, or the thrill of discovery!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755950/extras/41441c26862306933234790eef2b1b65.poster.avif?t=1754112872\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755950/extras/41441c26862306933234790eef2b1b65.webm?t=1754112872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755950/extras/41441c26862306933234790eef2b1b65.mp4?t=1754112872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755950/extras/d41f8613902e05b10c2583eddcefef6f.avif?t=1754112872\" data-has-big width=800 height=260 /></span>",
