\" >Chill &amp; Engaging Atmosphere</h2><br>Despite its depth, Tidebound maintains a relaxing and casual atmosphere. It's designed to be accessible to players who prefer a more laid-back gaming experience, yet it still offers enough complexity and challenge to keep more seasoned gamers engaged.<br><br>In summary, Tidebound is a rich and varied experience, offering players a unique blend of activities and challenges. Whether you're a fan of meticulous resource management, the calmness of fishing, the satisfaction of a well-tended farm, or the thrill of discovery!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755950/extras/41441c26862306933234790eef2b1b65.poster.avif?t=1754112872\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755950/extras/41441c26862306933234790eef2b1b65.webm?t=1754112872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755950/extras/41441c26862306933234790eef2b1b65.mp4?t=1754112872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755950/extras/d41f8613902e05b10c2583eddcefef6f.avif?t=1754112872\" data-has-big width=800 height=260 /></span>",
    "short_description": "Chill, catch, sell, upgrade! Tidebound is a fishing game with a relaxing, cozy atmosphere where you upgrade your boat, and sail further to fish for more expensive and exotic sea animals. Casual yet engaging, the game offers a sense of progress with tons of equipment and hundreds of species to catch.",
